        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sc5q",
          "text": "Colorado has over four million licensed drivers. Thus, it should surprise no one that car accidents occur frequently. However, many Coloradans have little knowledge about what to do after a car accident. For example, do you know how to report a car accident in Denver? If your answer is no, then you are not alone. The majority of Colorado drivers have no idea either. Fortunately, a Denver car accident lawyer can guide you through this process.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "bc5t",
      "style": "h3",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sc5s",
          "text": "Colorado Accident Report Requirements",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "bc5v",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sc5u",
          "text": "Colorado law requires you to report any accident that meets the following requirements:",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "bc5x",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sc5w",
          "text": "Results in personal injury or death",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "bc5z",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sc5y",
          "text": "Causes any property damage",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "bc64",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "lc61",
          "_type": "link",
          "href": "https://www.colorado.gov/pacific/sites/default/files/14%20MISD%20TRAF%20INTRO.pdf"
        }
      ],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sc60",
          "text": "There is no example of a car accident that would result in zero property damage. Thus, you must report your car accident to the proper authorities. If you fail to do so, then you could receive a ",
          "marks": []
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sc62",
          "text": "Class Two misdemeanor traffic offense",
          "marks": [
            "lc61"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sc63",
          "text": ".",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "bc66",
      "style": "h3",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sc65",
          "text": "Reporting a Denver Accident to the Police",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "bc6a",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sc67",
          "text": "If you were involved in a crash and a police officer was called to the scene and gathered all the necessary details, you are not required to file additional forms unless you receive written instructions from the Colorado Department of Revenue. In such cases, the notice will specify the next steps you must follow.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "bc6c",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sc6b",
          "text": "For truck accidents where no law enforcement officer arrives at the scene, you must report the incident yourself through one of the following methods:",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "bc6e",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sc6d",
          "text": "Online Reporting:",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "bc6h",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sc6f",
          "text": "Eligibility: ",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sc6g",
          "text": "You can submit a report online if the crash occurred within the City and County of Denver, is not ongoing, and does not involve stolen vehicles, firearms, or any known suspects.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "bc6k",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sc6i",
          "text": "How to file: ",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sc6j",
          "text": "Visit the Denver Police Department’s official website and access their online reporting portal.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "bc6n",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sc6l",
          "text": "Required Details",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sc6m",
          "text": ": Include the exact date, time, location, and a complete narrative of the incident.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "bc6p",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sc6o",
          "text": "In-Person Reporting:",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "bc6r",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sc6q",
          "text": "Contact: Call the Denver Police Department’s non-emergency number at (720) 913-2000 or go to the nearest station.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "bc6t",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sc6s",
          "text": "For Emergencies: Always dial 911.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "bc6x",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sc6u",
          "text": "When required: If your situation doesn’t qualify for online filing, you must report it in person.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "bc6z",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sc6y",
          "text": "Accident Types That May Require Filing:",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "bc71",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sc70",
          "text": "Truck crashes without police presence",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
